      "content": "There is no point in fighting a silence that has already won, because the struggle itself is the only thing keeping him alive in a world that no longer recognizes his effort. If he continues to try, he will only confirm his own inadequacy, and the only way to truly rest is to stop trying to matter at all. The silence isn't an enemy to be defeated; it is the only reality that exists when you decide to stop fighting.",
